Slashem is a fun nethack variant.

Some of the things about it are very cool, some are unbalancing.

Cool things:
1) Shopkeeper services
2) Cooler Sokoban levels
3) Mini-dungeon branches
4) Less boring hell.
5) Eventual de-polymorph - objects and monsters
6) Artifact armor
7) Alternative sacrifice boons (minion pets and blessed wielded/worn
items)

Unbalancing things:
1) Wands of draining (harder)
2) #Twoweaponing artifacts (easier)
3) The Black Market (easier)
4) Firearms (easier)
5) Thrown potions of amnesia (harder)

Some of the class/race combinations are almost unplayable, others are
insanely easy (doppelganger wizard).

Some of the conducts which are very tough in Nethack are more workable
in Slashem (atheist zen wizard for example).

Happy hacking.



